   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "## What this scene shows\nA traced **1D binary-hologram proxy**:\nfocus count, angular span, and scan offset\nchange the DMD pattern and rays at the resin.\n\n**Not simulated:** Lee/WGS hologram synthesis,\n2D/3D focal fields, focus uniformity, single-pulse\npolymerization, dose, diffusion, or cure kinetics.\n\nReported nonlinear coefficients are **6.65–8.65**;\nthis is not a calibrated two-photon-only model.\n\n*Free interpretation — exact beam diameters,\nmechanical spacings, and compact fold packing\nare not specified in the paper.*",
    "fontSize": 11,
    "fill": "#334155"
   }
  },
